id: heavy-suppression-overwhelming-strike
name: Overwhelming Strike
order: 1
slot: trait
description: >
  Any worm that dares to raise a hand against you will find that your brutality and power can pierce even the toughest hides.
text: >
  Overwhelming Strike: Any worm that dares to raise a hand against you will find that your brutality and power can pierce even the toughest hides.
  (1)-[Passive]: While you are in the Healthy Health Threshold, increase the Damage Category of all of your Signature Techniques by 1 Category.
  (2)-[Passive]: If you are above the Injured Health Threshold, increase the Wound Rolls of your Signature Techniques by x(T), where x is equal to their Damage Category.
  (3)-[Triggered/Transform, 1/Round]: Enter the Superior State until the start of your next turn.

---

# (1)(2) The Damage Category and Wound by it: the table's.

# (3) Entering it, once a Round: Superior till the start of your next turn.
[triggered/transform, 1/round, effect 3]
enterState(superior, 1, start-of-next-turn);
